---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import PageIntro from '../components/PageIntro.astro';
---
<BaseLayout title="Privacy | Lead Strategy" description="Lead Strategy privacy notice.">
	<PageIntro kicker="Legal" title="Privacy" lead="A plain-language launch draft for review before personal information is collected on the public site." />
	<section class="wrap sec"><div class="notice"><strong>Review required before launch</strong><span>This operational draft must be checked against the final form, analytics, email and payment vendors.</span></div><div class="legal-copy" style="margin-top: 50px;"><h2>What we collect</h2><p>When you contact us, we may collect your name, email address, organization, project interests and the information you choose to include in your message.</p><h2>Why we collect it</h2><p>We use enquiry information to respond, scope work, prevent abuse and maintain business records. We will not add an enquirer to marketing email without separate consent.</p><h2>Service providers</h2><p>Approved hosting, security, analytics, email and payment providers may process limited information on our behalf. The final vendor list and cross-border processing details will be added before launch.</p><h2>Your choices</h2><p>You may ask about, correct or request deletion of personal information we control, subject to legal retention requirements, by emailing <a href="mailto:hello@leadstrategy.ca">hello@leadstrategy.ca</a>.</p><h2>Updates</h2><p>This notice will show its effective date and material changes when the production vendor configuration is approved.</p></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
